kmldonkey (2.1.5) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix memory-leaks and Javascript ownership-issues with SearchQuery-QObject's
  * Fix those starting another search from the same search-query page could fail once more
  * Fix made the application more robust in the case things go wrong
  * Fix prevent switching from online to offline when connected with a host
  * Fix proper disconnect when switching from online to offline rather then waiting for a socket-timeout
  * Fix reconnect with internet when online-state changes to offline and both, auto reconnect and connect with internet on demand, is enabled
  * Optimize CPU-usage by updating the transfer-page only once every two seconds and only if the page is visible
  * Add support for multiple hosts
  * Add button to search-page to close and forget remembered search results
  * Add notification on error and an option to settings to enable/disable them
  * Add option to settings to optionally show a progressbar rather then the % label at the transfer-page
  * Use inverted theme as default since its official recommend to save battery

 -- Sebastian Sauer <mail@dipe.org>  Mon, 09 Apr 2012 07:58:01 +0100

kmldonkey (2.1.4) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix starting another search from the same search-query page could fail
  * Fix file vanished from Transfer-page when state changed from downloading to complete
  * Add an additional label to the connection-page to provide more describing details when connecting failed

