kmldonkey (2.1.2) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix query-string sometimes not proper displayed on Search-page for new searches
  * Fix file not removed from Transfer-page after saving
  * Fix more cases where the wrong connection-state was displayed on connection-error
  * Fix don't allow to emit console commands when disconnected from host
  * Fix various things related to inverted themes
  * Optimize CPU-usage and fix memory-leaks caused by pageStack.pop() not working as expected
  * Add live-update when viewing the properties of a single file on the Transfer-page
  * Add better visual help to search-results by colouring according to alreadyDone/availability

 -- Sebastian Sauer <mail@dipe.org>  Mon, 25 Mar 2012 13:42:54 +0100

kmldonkey (2.1.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix possibility that the same search-identifier was used for different searches
  * Fix downloaded file was not removed from list of downloaded files when saved/cancelled
  * Fix sometimes wrong connection-state displayed on connection-error
  * Fix reconnect-on-disconnect did not try to go online when offline
  * Fix console not cleared when disconnected
  * Fix filename rather then network was displayed for search-results
  * Fix sorting and grouping in the transfer-page
  * Fix flickable at search-query was not flickable as expected
  * Fix proper hide file-buttons at transfer-page if they are unrelated to the download-state
  * Add button to transfer-page to save completed files
  * Add option to settings to enable/disable connect to host on startup
  * Add option to settings to enable/disable connect with internet on demand
  * Add option to settings to enable/disable inverting the theme

 -- Sebastian Sauer <mail@dipe.org>  Mon, 24 Mar 2012 22:11:45 +0100

kmldonkey (2.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial Release of a QML based version of KMLDonkey for MeeGo.
    Code got pushed to http://websvn.kde.org/trunk/extragear/network/kmldonkey/
    * The qml/* directory contains the MeeGo version and uses qmake
    * The kmldonkey/* directory contains the KDE desktop client and uses cmake
    * The libkmldonkey/* directory contains the shared core-library used in qml/* and kmldonkey/*

 -- Sebastian Sauer <mail@dipe.org>  Mon, 20 Feb 2012 02:22:57 +0100
